Note: This code uses the `libcamera` library to capture images, which is a part of the Raspbian operating system. The `libcamera` library is not included in the standard C library, so you need to install it separately. You can install it using the following command:

```bash
sudo apt-get install libcamera-dev
```

Also, this code assumes that the `libcamera` library is installed and configured correctly. If you encounter any issues, you may need to adjust the library paths or configuration.

