This code initializes the GPIO, opens the I2C file descriptor and log file, sets the I2C clock speed, reads the temperature, converts it to Celsius, appends it to the log file with a timestamp, sleeps for 5 seconds, and then closes the I2C file descriptor and log file. It handles I2C initialization failures, sensor-absent scenarios, and file I/O errors in a graceful manner, and catches SIGINT to cleanly release resources.

