This code sets up the ADXL345 accelerometer on the Raspberry Pi's I2C bus, configures the sensor, and reads acceleration data when the device is in free-fall mode. It writes the data to a log file named `freefall_log_23-09-11.csv` in the current working directory. The program exits cleanly when SIGINT or SIGTERM is received.

