This code uses the `pigpio` library to control the GPIO pins and the `time` library to handle the timing. It reads the schedule from a file named `lighting_schedule.txt` and controls the relays accordingly. The `fade_relay` function is used to fade the relays on and off, and the `turn_on_relay` and `turn_off_relay` functions are used to turn the relays on and off. The `sigint_handler` and `sigterm_handler` functions are used to handle the SIGINT and SIGTERM signals, respectively. The code also includes error checking and cleanup to ensure that the GPIO pins are properly cleaned up when the program exits.

