This code uses the `pigpio` library to interact with the I2C bus and the `libgen` library to get the current time. It also uses the `unistd` library to perform file operations and the `signal` library to set up signal handlers. The code checks for errors and retries transient failures up to three times with a 10ms backoff. It also handles SIGINT and SIGTERM signals to gracefully shut down by closing the I2C file descriptor and flushing and closing the CSV file on all exit paths.

